          <p class="study">M.Sc. Computer Science, 1st semester; B.E. in Information Technology</p>
          <p>Harsh is studying computer science at Paderborn University after earning a B.E. in Information Technology. He is interested in machine learning and football, and cooks dishes his mother might not approve of. Models can explain code and write tests, he thinks, but they still need a human to supply the system’s history and context. In five to ten years, he expects developers to coordinate small teams of agents by breaking work into clear tasks and checking the results.</p>
