          <p class="fun-fact"><em>Fun fact: His CI pipeline has a better success rate than his alarm clock.</em></p>
          <p class="hot-take">🔥 Production access without a sandbox is chaos engineering with extra steps.</p>
        </article>

        <article class="member-card">
          <img src="{{image:krish.jpg}}" alt="Photo of Krish">
          <h3>Krish</h3>
          <p class="study">M.Sc. Computer Science, 1st semester at Paderborn University</p>
