          <p class="fun-fact"><em>Fun fact: He has named every one of his laptops after a Bollywood villain.</em></p>
          <p class="hot-take">🔥 An AI that writes 1,000 lines a minute means 1,000 lines a minute someone has to review.</p>
        </article>
